l3: Make router and namespace overrides match their bases

BaseRouterInfo.delete() and process() still declare an agent argument
that the 2015 router refactors removed from every subclass and caller,
so mypy flags each override. Drop it and its docstring line.

Namespace.create() takes ipv6_forwarding and
conntrack_tcp_timeout_established, but the router, SNAT, FIP and HA
namespaces drop one or both. Accept them and pass them through,
keeping each default: IPv6 forwarding on for SNAT and FIP, off for HA
namespaces until the router is primary, and the conntrack timeout
taken from the agent configuration unless the caller gives one. mypy
can now check the bodies in dvr_snat_ns.

